    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30855" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">neuras</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nevras</span></b> ), ădis, f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νευράς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The plant</i> manicon, <i>which
				excites the nerves</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 21,
				31, 105, § 179</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A plant, called also</i> poterion: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poterion, aut ut alii vocant, phrynion, vel
					nevras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					27, 12, 97, § 122</span></i>
			.</div>
